<main id="top"><section class="hero shell"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Author · Brand educator · Mom</p><h1>Make room for<br/><em>your voice.</em></h1><p class="lede">I help authors and creative experts build meaningful brands, share their ideas, and publish work they’re proud of without losing themselves in the process.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#book">Meet the book</a><a class="text-link" href="#resources">Browse resources ↓</a></div></div><div class="portrait"><div class="sun"></div><div class="arch"></div><div class="initials">LS</div><p>A creative business<br/>built for real life</p></div></section>
<section class="manifesto" id="about"><div class="shell manifesto-grid"><p class="eyebrow">My point of view</p><blockquote>“You don’t need more noise. You need a message that sounds like <em>you</em>.”</blockquote><div class="about-copy"><p>I’m Lily, an author, brand strategist, educator, and mom of two. For more than a decade, I’ve helped people find the clearest way to share what they know and create work that feels true to them.</p><p>I built this business around school runs, ordinary Tuesdays, and the belief that meaningful visibility should fit a real life.</p></div></div></section>
