<section class="coaching" id="coaching"><div class="shell coaching-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Private coaching</p><h2>A steady place to<br/><em>move forward.</em></h2><p>Personal support for the author, speaker, or creative expert who is ready to shape a clear brand and bring an important project into the world.</p></div><article class="coaching-card"><p class="eyebrow">One-to-one coaching</p><p class="price"><strong>$275</strong> / month</p><ul><li>Two private 60-minute Zoom calls each month</li><li>Personalized brand and content guidance</li><li>Clear next steps after every session</li><li>Email check-ins between calls</li></ul><a class="button" href="/coaching#intro">Book a complimentary introductory call</a><small>Sample offer and pricing for this concept website.</small></article></div></section>
